    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="19">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Northu">Northu</ref> 19</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif man ciricgrið abrece, bete be circan mæðe 7 be þam þe hire mund sy.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If anyone violates sanctuary, he is to pay compensation in proportion to the status of the church and according to what its right of protection is.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If anyone violates church sanctuary, compensation is to be paid according to the status of the church and according to its degree of protection.</ab>
      </div>
